message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "example_needle: page-level multimodal document retrieval"
abstract: >-
  A library for indexing and searching documents at the page level using
  multimodal (visual) embedders such as ColPali and ColQwen2, with a clean
  conversational-core domain and pluggable retriever backends.
type: software
authors:
